      {
       "name": "Arondight45_DroneFC_Core::Runtime_step",
       "from": "Arondight45_DroneFC_Core",
       "help": "Receiver/SBUS is only an input adapter. Once decoded, the flight runtime operates on a physical normalized Command. Higher-level controllers use step_command() directly instead of fabricating receiver frames.",
